  "description": "Tool to cancel a running pipeline in a GitLab project. Use this action when you need to stop a CI/CD pipeline that is currently executing or queued. Note that the API returns success (200) regardless of the pipeline's state, so this action can be safely called even if the pipeline has already finished or been canceled.",
